        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block Pile is a creative block-building and strategic deckbuilding roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a floating island in the sky by stacking, placing, and combining different types of blocks. Trigger chain reactions, accumulate points, and complete each round’s construction goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precise Placement: Ignite High-Scoring Chains</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/extras/a5e0729e977f09c91959bb2e5e25c48c.poster.avif?t=1778249745\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/extras/a5e0729e977f09c91959bb2e5e25c48c.webm?t=1778249745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/extras/a5e0729e977f09c91959bb2e5e25c48c.mp4?t=1778249745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place blocks precisely to set up massive chain scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger powerful reactions through block interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine smartly for explosive score growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, deep strategic mastery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Builds: Endless Combination Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/extras/8768792797d03e1de021b2c1e531bb9b.poster.avif?t=1778249745\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/extras/8768792797d03e1de021b2c1e531bb9b.webm?t=1778249745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/extras/8768792797d03e1de021b2c1e531bb9b.mp4?t=1778249745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of blocks to shape your own playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain rare blocks and items to strengthen your strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful item synergies amplify tactical effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run offers brand-new combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Construction Cycles: Survive the Shifting Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/extras/17235a228c79c0f508919ca2699c646a.poster.avif?t=1778249745\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/extras/17235a228c79c0f508919ca2699c646a.webm?t=1778249745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/extras/17235a228c79c0f508919ca2699c646a.mp4?t=1778249745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When available blocks run out, a new cycle begins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random choices reshape your build direction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing score thresholds raise the challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt and push your limits in ever-changing situations</p></li></ul>",
